  "reference": "1 Amakuru 11",
  "verseCount": 47,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma Isiraeli yona eteranira ahali Daudi omuli Heburoni, bagamba bati, “Leba ichwe tuli bawe buchwichwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makiro agahingwire, n'orwo Sauli abaire natwara, iwe n'iwe obaire notabaza Isiraeli nogihuruza. Kandi Omukama Ruhanga wawe akakugambira ati, ‘Oliba mushumba w'abantu bange, Isiraeli, kandi oliba mukama wabo.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo abagurusi bona ba Isiraeli baija Heburoni mbali Omukama Daudi yabaire asingire, Daudi akora nabo endagano omu maisho g'Omukama. Bamukora amajuta aba mukama wa Isiraeli, nk'okwo Omukama yabaire agambire omu kanwa ka Samweli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Daudi na Isiraeli yona bagya Yerusalemu, niyo Yebusi, mbali Abayebusi abanyansi baturaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyansi ba Yebusi bagambira Daudi bati, “Tolikwija kutaha munu.” Nawe Daudi akwata eboma ya Sioni, nikyo kigokye kikuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agamba ati, “Omuntu wena araba wa mbere kwita Abayebusi, ogwo araba mutwazi mara mukuru w'eihe.” Yoabu eya Seruya atabara ali wa mbere, kityo aba mutwazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi atura omu boma, nikwo eboma egyo kugyeta Kigo kya Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayombeka ekigo embaju zona kwema Milo obuzingora, kandi Yoabu ashemeza ebichweka by'ekigo ebisigaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ayeyongera kugira amani, kuba Omukama w'amahe yamwemagamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba nibo babaire bali bakuru b'abaisherukare emanzi za Daudi, abamwemiremu n'amani omu ngomaye, hamoi na Isiraeli yona kumuteka aha ngoma nk'okwo Omukama yabaire agambire ahali Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga nigo makuru g'abaisherukare emanzi za Daudi: Yashobeamu Omuhakimoni, niwe yabaire ali mukuru w'abashatu; akajunjumya eichumulye yaita abantu 300. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayamuhonderaga omu manzi zonshatu ni Eleazari eya Dodo, Omwahohi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba ali hamoi na Daudi omuli Pasidamimu orwo Abafilisiti bahuruliire kulinya kurashana. Akaba aliho endimiro y'eshayiri nyingi. AbaIsiraeli bairuka Abafilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai wenene akemelera omu musiri omugati yagurashanira, yaita Abafilisiti abo, Omukama yabarokora, basinga muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashatu omu bakuru b'amakumi gashatu, bagya aha rwazi mbali Daudi yabaire ali aha mpako ya Adulamu, orwo eihe ly'Abafilisiti lyabaire lisisire omu Ruhanga rwa Refaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi omu kanya kalinya akaba ali omu boma, kandi eihe ly'Abafilisiti likaba lili Betelehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi agira eiliho, agamba ati, “K'omuntu yakumpa amaizi g'eiziba lya Betelehemu bwatana aha kihigi, nkaganywa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo emanzi ezo zonshatu kushenshera orusisira rw'Abafilisiti, zigya zitaha amaizi aha iziba lya Betelehemu elyabaire lyataine ekihigi, zigaletera Daudi. Kyonkai Daudi tiyaganyoire, shana akagashesha ahansi yagahongera Omukama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yagamba ati, “Nikikabure inye kugira nti omu maisho ga Ruhanga wange. Nywe amaizi agaba gaizire kwisa abantu aba? Kuba n'orwo bagaleta baba benagire omu kabi.” Aha rw'ekyo tiyaganyoire. Ebi bikakorwa emanzi ezi zonshatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishai eya Yoabu niwe yabaire ali mukuru w'amakumi gashatu. Ajunjumya eichumulye alirasira abantu bikumi bishatu abaita; nawe agira eibara nk'abashatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu makumi gashatu yagiraga eiranga kubashaga, nangu yaba mukuru wabo, kyonkai abashatu tiyabagobire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya eya Yehoyada akaba ali mushaija emanzi eya Kabuzeeli, ayakoraga ebikorwa by'amaani; niwe yaisire entare ibili rururuma eza Moabu. Akashuba yasongoka yaitira entare omu kina kiro eky'eseruji yarara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaita Omumisri w'ekyema kingi, aina oburai bulikushaga omu mita ibili. Omumisri ogwo akaba akwete eichumu nilishusha orubaho rw'omushuki w'emyendo. Kyonkai Benaya asongoka amugoba n'enkoni, amushwaikura eichumu, aba nilyo amwisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi bikakorwa Benaya eya Yehoyada, yagira eibara nka balinya abashatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaranganwaga omu 30, kyonkai abashatu tiyabagobire. Aho Daudi amweta amuhindura mukuru w'abalinzibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashaija emanzi omu mahe akaba ali Asaheli murumuna Yoabu, Elihanani eya Dodo owa Betelehemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shamoti eya Harodi, Helesi Omupeloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ira eya Ikeshi owa Tekoa, Abiezeri owa Anatoti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibekai owa Husha, Ilai owa Ahohi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maharai owa Netofati, Heledi eya Baana owa Netofati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itai eya Ribai owa Gibea Omubenjamini, Benaya owa Piratoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hurai ow'obwiga bwa Gashi, Abieli owa Ariba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azimaweti owa Bahurumi, Eliaba owa Shaalaboni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashemu owa Gizoni, Yonatani eya Shagi owa Harari, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahiamu eya Sakari owa Harari, Elifali eya Uri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
